<title>SWEDEN: Moody's places Enso under review.</title>
<headline>Moody's places Enso under review.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. credit ratings agency Moody's said on Friday it had placed Finnish forestry group Enso Oy under review for a possible downgrade following its acquisition of a majority stake in Germany's E. Holtzmann &amp; Cie AG.</p>
<p>The purchase would substantially raise borrowing levels at Enso and &quot;may have a material impact on the debt protection measurements of the Enso group at a low point in the paper cycle,&quot; Moody's said.</p>
</text>
